Package: shizuku-termux
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: shizuku-termux fusion
Description: Termux<->Shizuku bridge (single core)
 Installs, validates and uses Shizuku/rish in Termux within the official
 Rikka protocol. Zero .dex/.so/.apk in the package; the DEX extraction
 happens on the device via `shizuku install --apk <path>` or
 `shizuku install` (if `pm` finds moe.shizuku.privileged.api).
Depends: bash, coreutils, findutils, unzip
